   {
    "h": "Etymology",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "The specific name, heyerorum (genitive, plural), is in honor of American herpetologist William Ronald \"Ron\" Heyer and his wife Miriam."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Geographic range",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
